{% extends "project/base.html.twig" %}

{% block title %}About{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <div class="about">
        <h2>
            Welcome to the mini-point and click-adventure game!
        </h2>
        <h3>The Story:</h3>
        You have been invited to spend time with your friends in a magical forest. <br>
        Navigate the forest paths to find your friends. In your pocket you have a map that'll help you find your way and your magical key that will help you pass the magical flower field.<br> 
        And remember to- oh wait, it seems you've dropped your key…perhaps you should look for it.<br><br>

        <h3>In this point and click game you can:</h3>
        Navigate between 5 rooms using the <b>path options</b>.<br>
        Some paths require you to have a <i>specific item</i> to let you go to the next room.<br>
        Use the <b>choices option</b> to interact with the world and pick up <b>items</b> along the way.<br>
        Items are stored in your trusty <b>backpack</b>. You can show these items off to most people you encounter.<br>
        There are <b>6 collectable items</b> to be found, and if you've collected 3 specific items you have unlocked a <i>secret</i> bonus item.
        <br><br>
        If you find yourself stuck you can <b>check your map</b> in the choices option, or use your clairvoyance - that is, you can <b>enable the cheat sheet</b> in the menu. <br>
        That makes the game easier and maybe even more fun - try it! The cheat sheet enables 2 of the shortest paths you can take to clear the game and it enables path leads to room number, and what room number you're currently in.<br>
        Note that once you've successfully found room 5 the game ends and you can't go back to find more items.<br>
        You can reset the game and start over at any time by clicking the reset button in the menu. Enjoy!
<br><br>
    </div>
    <div class="about"> <h3>Credits:</h3> <br>
    Art by betidraws on pixabay.com</div>
    <div class="about"><h3>Database</h3>
        Do you want to read more about the database uses?<br>
        <a href="{{ path('database') }}">click here!</a>
    </div>
{% endblock %}